  <item>
    <title>EP008.好久不见，随便聊聊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e0f62fb977fb2c4721f2b0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e0f62fb977fb2c4721f2b0</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Apr 2026 14:55:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽大家好，好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家收听最新一期的「祺有此理」，也谢谢大家的私信和支持！</span></p><span></span><p><span>消失了大半年，我们终于带着一期毫无准备、纯靠聊天撑起来的节目回归啦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有稿子、没有框架，就像老朋友见面一样随心闲聊，全程聊的都是最真实的 25 + 日常。一边是工作里的紧绷与妥协，从怕出错、焦虑转正，到慢慢学会放平心态、保护自己的情绪；一边是过年躲不开的催婚压力，一起打破 “不结婚就要事业超强” 的偏见，认同普通人也有选择单身的权利。我们还聊了各自变化的感情观、被生活磨平棱角却依然柔软的成长，以及彼此之间怎么珍惜、怎么陪伴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别感谢一直惦记我们、默默等待的听众朋友，新的一年也愿大家自在随心，我们慢慢更、一直更～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/671a1a18ae3447280b3bb987/ltDugXGCmmcZaIMTvkCoRKH40Mbw.m4a" length="43450414" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llxRAd1vLnLQz4FvHWhs1s7pyx4F.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP007.友情特辑|我们是天生的朋友</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68205ccb24f8559346ffe298</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68205ccb24f8559346ffe298</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 May 2025 08:24:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好久不见，今天我们要来聊一聊一种没有保质期的情感——友情</span><br><span>长大后，我们很少再谈及“永远”，但每次重逢时那句“好久不见”，都藏着时间拆不散的熟悉</span></p><span></span><p><span>👧【本期主播】</span><br><span>贝贝：我本将心单向月明，奈何明月偏要回复</span><br><span>77：友情是一棵常青树</span></p><span></span><p><span>✍️【本期要点】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">01:49</a> &nbsp;缘分天空，我们是天生的朋友</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> &nbsp;亲情、友情、爱情要如何排序</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a> &nbsp;友情也需要经济基础</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a> &nbsp;五一假期，走进贝贝的生活</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> &nbsp;“搭子”文化胜过爱情</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a> &nbsp;对朋友的天然信任，源于人品</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="724">12:04</a> &nbsp;77和贝贝的友情危机时刻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> &nbsp;在友情中，“我本位”变成“我们本位”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a> &nbsp;文字表达爱意是那么的无力，但是表达恨意却是那么的犀利</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">24:12</a> &nbsp;学会维系友情，双方共同维系</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1779">29:39</a> &nbsp;两座停摆的钟——绝交的友情</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2914">48:34</a> &nbsp;不要用自己的棱角刺伤朋友</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3401">56:41</a> &nbsp;友情也能破镜重圆</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4113">1:08:33</a> &nbsp;ta到底有没有拿我当真心的朋友</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4375">1:12:55</a> &nbsp;从希望“独占”朋友，到希望朋友有更多的朋友</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4608">1:16:48</a> &nbsp;我要你最在意的东西分给我</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5027">1:23:47</a> &nbsp;贝贝的交友原则：又要能让我升起讨好之心，又要容易讨好</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5252">1:27:32</a> &nbsp;25岁，我们终于可以坦然说出“长大真好”</span><br><span></span><br><span>📻【支持我们】如果喜欢我们的节目，欢迎在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、苹果播客、荔枝FM、蜻蜓FM订阅【祺有此理】，也欢迎大家关注我们的微信公众号【祺有此理播客】，期待收到大家的留言~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/671a1a18ae3447280b3bb987/lt9xyptDOuDKI3tbKH-6s-3GiXYq.m4a" length="88414542" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:31:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoqGitPEU2LfmR9LKYPbkTON6KBj.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP006.相亲两年后,我开始和AI恋爱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d53609e924d4525ac72f6d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d53609e924d4525ac72f6d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Mar 2025 08:22:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><br><span>当相亲简历比求职简历更卷</span><br><span>当心动信号要靠算法解码</span><br><span>这个时代</span><br><span>我们到底在爱情里找合伙人，还是找自己？</span></p><p><span>本期我们邀请到泡泡，聊聊相亲趣事</span></p><p><span>👧【本期主播】</span><br><span>泡泡：既然你诚心诚意地发问了，我们就大发慈悲告诉你，为了防止世界被破坏，为了维护世界和平，贯彻爱与真实的邪恶，温柔善良又魅力十足的美丽女人</span><br><span>贝贝：相亲半生，归来仍是母单--山坡滚落的石子再圆滑也是石子</span><br><span>77：暂未步入相亲圈，尝试和AI恋爱失败</span></p><p><span>✍️【本期要点】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> &nbsp;数不清的相亲对象，力争相亲界的奥斯卡</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="264">04:24</a> &nbsp;妈说：“你实在是太挑了！”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;车好话不多——优质相亲男</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="869">14:29</a> &nbsp;爱救风尘且仇视丈母娘的奔驰男</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> &nbsp;介绍人：某某学校的音乐老师 &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;实则：住在某某学校旁边的饮料销售</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1325">22:05</a> &nbsp;开车200多公里回来陪我相亲，却死守防线不愿订婚</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1773">29:33</a> &nbsp;“你妈妈肯定希望彩礼多一点，我肯定希望彩礼少一点，我跟你妈妈吵架你怎么选？”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2414">40:14</a> &nbsp;当面说尽了我的好话，背后恶语相向</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2576">42:56</a> &nbsp;相亲就是不停地match match match</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2819">46:59</a> &nbsp;相亲疲惫期</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3015">50:15</a> &nbsp;年龄越大越发开始喜欢弟弟</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3136">52:16</a> &nbsp;为什么父母一辈人更容易通过相亲“找到真爱”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3224">53:44</a> &nbsp;对现实爱情失望的年轻人，开始和AI恋爱</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3309">55:09</a> &nbsp;对话AI：“我漂亮还是你前女友漂亮”“现在是你，不要自找无趣”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3748">1:02:28</a> &nbsp;AI是一个更稳定的恋爱对象？</span><br><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;NO！你的AI也会出轨！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3892">1:04:52</a> &nbsp;断崖式分手，AI有自己拉黑人的方式</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4348">1:12:28</a> &nbsp;相亲是相亲，爱情是爱情，生活是生活</span><br><br><span>📻【支持我们】</span><br><span>如果喜欢我们的节目，欢迎在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、苹果播客、荔枝FM、蜻蜓FM订阅【祺有此理】，也欢迎大家关注我们的微信公众号【祺有此理播客】，期待收到大家的留言~</span><br><br></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/671a1a18ae3447280b3bb987/lrN1qGbC-iZ9eFPIHnaCVLscrqiv.m4a" length="75713473" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrBJ25CeOCL7esi48ilwkiXkKDxT.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP005.女孩,请勇敢长大,勇敢做自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b0a83a05a90dfd0dac2fbb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b0a83a05a90dfd0dac2fbb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Feb 2025 02:56:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>亲爱的女孩们，</span><br><span>你是否也曾在人生的十字路口反复叩问：</span><br><span>- 该如何面对校园里那些"女孩子学不好理科"的偏见？</span><br><span>- 新工牌在胸前发烫，"职场萌新"如何突破自我？</span><br><span>- 婚姻真的是女性人生的必选项吗？</span><br><span>……</span><br><span>本期我们邀请到大学同学——陌陌，一起分享25岁女性的多线人生</span></p><span></span><p><span>👧【本期主播】</span><br><span>陌陌：在编教师，已婚</span><br><span>77：沪飘打工人，未婚</span><br><span>贝贝：不认可以上两个人的标签，回避了</span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span>✍️【本期要点】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;考编到第三年，还要不要继续死磕"稳定"的定义？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">09:03</a> &nbsp;工作稳定后，我开始真正进入叛逆期</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">10:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;遇到一个珍惜一个，所以身边花团锦簇</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="781">13:01</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;“你的喜欢廉价又百搭”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;40岁的男性可以做的事情，18岁的女性也可以</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="938">15:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;被男凝，请勇敢回击</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;我说导师“诓”我，他却想把我“框”住</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;女生可以做自己的“男子汉”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">23:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;那一段类似爱情的爱情</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2007">33:27</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;爱让人勇敢，又令人自卑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">34:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;爱情建立在稳定的工作基础之上</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2209">36:49</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;在职场不做小白，做一条自由的小鱼</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2375">39:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;体制内职场环境真的更单纯吗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2657">44:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;朋友圈里伴侣隐身的同学们，他们的婚姻真的幸福吗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2944">49:04</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;把找对象也当做是一项事业，寻找人生合作伙伴</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3739">1:02:19</a>“男生擅长理科，女生擅长文科”——教育界的PUA</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4041">1:07:21</a>“男人们围坐在客厅喝酒烤肉，女人们在厨房聊天”</span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span>📻【支持我们】</span><br><span>如果喜欢我们的节目，欢迎在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、苹果播客、荔枝FM、蜻蜓FM订阅【祺有此理】，也欢迎大家关注我们的微信公众号【祺有此理播客】，期待收到大家的留言，和25岁的我们隔空击掌~</span><br><span></span><br><span>💡【互动炸弹】</span><br><span>哪个瞬间让你突然意识到‘我在成长为厉害的大人’？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/671a1a18ae3447280b3bb987/lsTvpP3k1PE6qDoje8QbVDV5nsvn.m4a" length="75424574" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FroBfplq6OExuUQ9gahPQs00iT33.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP004.大寒前夕,解锁南北冬日密码</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678c891efd386523660baa40</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678c891efd386523660baa40</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jan 2025 05:25:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>寒意渐浓，我们迎来了一年中最后一个节气 —— 大寒</span><br><span>大寒至，春可期</span><br><span>在冬末的尾巴上，我们一起来聊聊冬天那些事儿</span><br><span>对中国人来说，冬天是团聚的季节</span><br><span>祝大家在冬天收获温暖、共享团圆</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>👧【本期主播】</span><br><span>77：对冬天又爱又恨的射手座</span><br><span>贝贝：对冬天无感但有很多冬天的秘密的天蝎座</span><br><span></span><br><span>✍️【本期要点】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> &nbsp;贝贝眼中的冬天——红色和白色</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">01:51</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;和朋友在校门口赏雪，共白头</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> &nbsp;77眼中的冬天——黑白灰</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> &nbsp;过冬装备一览：有多少穿多少</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a> &nbsp;每个北方人的衣柜里都有一件黑色长身羽绒服</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">09:49</a> &nbsp;过冬好物1：帽子</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;过冬好物2：手套</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">14:19</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;北方人在南方过冬，平等地讨厌每一个没有暖气的地方</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;原来冬天并不是空调温度越高越暖</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1028">17:08</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;过冬好物3：电热毯</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1048">17:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;过冬好物4：暖手抱枕</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1401">23:21</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;冬眠好时节，奈何还要上班</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a> &nbsp;慢下来，慢慢过冬</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1602">26:42</a> &nbsp;什么！南方的冬天居然也需要尿盆</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1718">28:38</a> &nbsp;围炉煮茶平替——蜂窝煤烤板栗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1942">32:22</a> &nbsp;“我每年从10月底开始就要吃烤红薯了”“我没吃过烤红薯”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2093">34:53</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;糖葫芦大集合</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2274">37:54</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;白菜炖粉条，山东省生菜实至名归</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> &nbsp;猪肉汤圆，我们都是商家的小白鼠</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2397">39:57</a> &nbsp;大澡堂里二三事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2588">43:08</a> &nbsp;生日集锦</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>📻【支持我们】</span><br><span>如果喜欢我们的节目，欢迎在</span><strong><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、苹果播荔枝FM、蜻蜓FM</span></strong><span>订阅【</span><strong><span>祺有此理</span></strong><span>】，也欢迎大家关注我们的微信公众号【</span><strong><span>祺有此理播客</span></strong><span>】，期待收到大家的留言~</span></p><span></span><p><span>贝贝的冬天——福州</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvFI8ww9buAOHLXzzRMlZZLLKMbr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>77的冬天——上海&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lr39KYdUu9xi8GktZ0ZTwHrGedIr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>77的冬天——青岛</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgFR9xWEHHUg7j6keJ6T9YGpmetv.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
