  <item>
    <title>EP003.我们的2024|一年很短,365天很长</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677f9e86cda04ef4c1906cc5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677f9e86cda04ef4c1906cc5</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 Jan 2025 12:11:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>77和贝贝是一对性格迥异的朋友</span><br><span>2024年她们在各自的太空中翱翔，又在友谊的星球相逢</span><br><span>拥抱真实 无惧成长</span><br><span>欢迎收听我们的2024</span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span>👧【本期主播】</span><br><span>77：写日记十年却从来不写年终总结</span><br><span>贝贝：从不写日记却每年都写年终总结</span><br><span></span><br><span>✍️【本期要点】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">02:14</a> &nbsp;年终总结那回事，想写又觉得麻烦，想分享又略带羞耻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a> &nbsp;多地跨年倒数后陷入沉默，我们印象深刻的跨年日</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a> &nbsp;新年祝福语一定要语音消息送达才尽显诚意</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a> &nbsp;贝贝的2024年度关键词——幸福</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="728">12:08</a> &nbsp;77的2024年度关键词——成长</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> &nbsp;长大，是终于开始理解妈妈</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1168">19:28</a> &nbsp;贝贝人生新体验：“打石膏的文科生没有一个不觉得自己是史铁生”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">22:24</a> &nbsp;77带妈妈看世界的第一年，希望妈妈慢点变老</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1476">24:36</a> &nbsp;贝贝收获真挚友谊，第一组闺蜜写真</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1569">26:09</a> &nbsp;捧着人生的第一束花，77为自己的求学生涯画上句号</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">27:53</a> &nbsp;77生日当天想满足贝贝的心愿，反而阴差阳错收到了小蛋糕</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1926">32:06</a> &nbsp;77的年度书籍《霍乱时期的爱情》——“我没想过见面要有什么意义”</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;异乡求学七年，成为大地上的异乡者</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2134">35:34</a> &nbsp;贝贝的阅读分享——《地下室手记》《你当像鸟飞往你的山》《悉达多》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2509">41:49</a> &nbsp;东亚亲情：一生所追求的母爱</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2899">48:19</a> &nbsp;“2024年很幸福的一件事是去了很多地方旅游”</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;“我的话反而不太喜欢旅游”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3006">50:06</a> &nbsp;朴实却真诚的2025新年期待</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3136">52:16</a> &nbsp;尼采1882年的新年寄语</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3197">53:17</a> &nbsp;加缪1940年的新年寄语</span></p><span></span><p><span>📻【支持我们】</span><br><span>如果喜欢我们的节目，欢迎在</span><strong><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、苹果播荔枝FM、蜻蜓FM</span></strong><span>订阅【</span><strong><span>祺有此理</span></strong><span>】，也欢迎大家关注我们的微信公众号【</span><strong><span>祺有此理播客</span></strong><span>】，期待收到大家的留言~</span></p>]]></description>
